  Okay, here's another suggested new character class- the Nethack player!
Yes, those interested in self-referentialism now can have it all, as your
alter-ego becomes you yourself, the nethack player!
  This class has average physical stats, high intelligence, low wisdom (or
else they wouldn't subject themself to such punishment!), and low charisma
(Nethack...  it's like playing a Mud, only with less social interaction!)
Starting intrinsics include sleep resistance (to make it through *yawn* just...
one... more... level...) and poison resistance (developed through years of
eating nothing but cold pizza, doritos, and jolt/iced coffee).  The quest
objective is a copy of the WCST Spoilers, which in game terms is a sort of
long-range stethescope, also allowing a certain chance to identify items.
  Stay tuned for more fun character classes, including the Shopkeeper and
Grid Bug...



